SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS Vinyasa Flow\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**Note earlier time\, beginning at 9am
 \, due to summer heat.** Join us for a vinyasa flow to yin practice ending
  in savasana. Join our community and meet other like-minded people! Yoga h
 eals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature™.\n\nBEGINNERS WELCOME AND MODIFICATI
 ONS PROVIDED.\n\nPractice vinyasa flow to yin yoga at North Carolina Museu
 m of Art\, outdoors near upper parking area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS
  GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other groups that use NCMA grounds). WHEN Y
 OU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE THE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE
  RIDGE MEET\, AWAY FROM THE MUSEUM. We practice in the grass Ellipse area:
 )\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander (0862)\nPaypal dgenander@yoga
 innature.com\nZelle\n\nCome flow with us. Meet others and make friends in 
 our yoga community.\nBring a mat or towel for the ground\; water\; sunscre
 en\; and anything else you may need for your outdoor yoga practice. You ma
 y also want a plastic liner for under your mat\, if the grass is damp.\nAL
 L LEVELS WELCOME.
