DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**SUMMER SOLSTICE YOGA (AND INTERNATIO
 NAL YOGA DAY) CELEBRATION!!!** Focus will be on light (longest day of the 
 year on 6/21) and infusing optimism into our practice and life! **BRING A 
 FRIEND FOR FREE. (***JUST ADD A +1 TO YOUR ATTENDANCE)*\nALL LEVELS vinyas
 a flow to yin yoga practice\, and beginners/ first timers always welcome. 
 Come for the yoga practice at this amazing location in nature. Stay after 
 class for community gathering\, go for a hike along the connecting trails 
 or sit with friends or a book/journal. Make it a morning to enjoy nature!\
 n$15 paid by Venmo @Darlene-Genander (0862 if asked)\nor by PayPal dgenand
 er@yogainnature.com\nalso accepting Zelle\n\nBring a mat\, large towel or 
 liner (for under your mat to protect it from wet ground)\, water\, sunscre
 en\, insect repellant.\n\nPlease arrive early if you are new to Yoga In Na
 ture to sign waiver and to meet prior to class. Thanks!
